      "review_description": "Getting solar powered electricity was a no brainer! It is very important to do your own research to help make the right decision. Robert Smith from Solar Intelligence explained all aspects including researching of solar installers integrity via Fair Trading, ABN and License No, Insurance certificate, how long a company has been in business, quality of products and services. Robert was the only person to explain how much my future electricity bills would cost to the $dollar by explaining the formula. When I compared Solar Intelligence's detailed quote with other Installers, I found the others fell short on knowledge. I opted for a quality installation and everything was done to plan and without delay. Seven months later after install, I contacted Solar Intelligence to discuss the new energy cost changes that had commenced and Robert was only too happy to provide after service advice as to who would offer the best deal for my size system and local grid provider. Their service is first class and I have already recommended Solar Intelligence to others. I have a quality system and I am very happy with the final outcome from Solar intelligence. I'm sure you can be as well.",
